@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
hide footbox
actor "Gudang / Admin" as P0
participant "InventoryView" as P1
participant "Store inventori" as P2
participant "PurchaseUnitView" as P3
P0 -> P1: Cari SKU dan tinjau stok
P1 -> P2: Baca inventori terbaru
P2 --> P1: Data stok
P0 -> P1: Pilih Deploy
P1 -> P2: Validasi dan kurangi satu
P2 -> P2: Simpan snapshot lokal
P2 --> P1: Stok setelah simpan
P1 --> P0: Perbarui tabel dan ringkasan
P0 -> P1: Pilih draf restock
P1 -> P3: Teruskan SKU dan qty
P3 --> P0: Form PO untuk dilengkapi
@enduml